        "tree_id": "f9436aab81cc55238920dc32759b0d4cf83f61ba",
        "message": "feat(db)+feat(core): the M11 authentication layer — session issuance, the §14.9 floor for every principal, RFC 6238 TOTP mandatory for approval-capable roles, failed-login lockout for all accounts, and the retirement of the request-carried identity interim (D-031)\n\n- packages/core/modules/auth: the policy floor (30-min idle / 8-h absolute, §14.9 verbatim), RFC 6238 TOTP (Appendix-B vectors stated from the RFC text — the sixth cross-checked against rfc-editor.org after a hand-copied memory value disagreed with a correct implementation), the session lifecycle, lockout, password policy, the sign-in machine; 27 tests incl. auth/mfa-approvals + auth/session-policy named proofs and the parity pin to the C3 APPROVAL_ELIGIBLE authority\n- 0005_auth + auth-adapter: user_credential (scrypt at rest — the named Argon2id deviation; production passwords live in the OIDC IdP), mfa_enrolment (AES-256-GCM wrap-at-rest, injected key; last_used_step replay guard with a row-level WHERE backstop), user_session (token stored ONLY as SHA-256; idle derived, absolute pinned, tombstone termination), login_attempt (append-only, the ledger pattern); attemptLogin composes the machine in ONE atomic unit; Class-N blocks append INSIDE the caller's tx — AWAITED (live-caught: a fire-and-forget statement interleaves protocol frames and reads GUC state from whatever tx is current when the round-trip lands)\n- the mfa_gate RESTRICTIVE policy on approval: app.mfa_ok='true' or 42501 — never-set NULL and EMPTY both refuse, fail-closed every shape (the API+DB pair; sod-live opens the gate for its SoD proofs)\n- the boundary retires the interim BY NAME: /api/plan refuses a body-carried tenantId, /api/data-health refuses ?tenant= — identity comes from the session (httpOnly cookie, token hashed at rest), resolved once in lib/auth-server, and the boundary sets the GUC trio tenant/actor/mfa transaction-local; /api/auth/login + /api/auth/logout + /api/auth/session/tenant are the thin transports\n- auth-live.js (28 checks on real PostgreSQL): rotation, lockout over real rows, append-only 42501s, wrap-at-rest, replay refusal, expiry by name, the tombstone, the mfa_gate named proof, the Class-N block; SCHEMA_VERSION 0005; @sentinel/db 0.6.0",
